+# System Architecture
+
+> **Draft / Non-authoritative.** `SPEC.md` remains authoritative until the controlled documentation cutover. This document owns system boundaries, data flow, rendering, caching, and recovery. It does not redefine product scope, data schema or scoring, API payload contracts, SEO quality gates, or deployment procedure.
+
+## System boundaries
+
+<!-- requirement
+id: ARCH-LAYERS-001
+status: Active
