+<a id="ARCH-DATAFLOW-001"></a>
+
+### ARCH-DATAFLOW-001 — Scheduled write path and precomputed read path
+
+The hourly weather flow is the only weather write path:
+
+```text
+Cron Trigger (hourly)
+  1. acquire D1 lock for "weather-sync" with a 15-minute expiry; abort if held
+  2. create a running sync run for the primary provider
+  3. fetch bounded city batches; on primary exhaustion, try the configured fallback
+  4. validate provider DTOs and normalize them to internal types
+  5. record each failed city and continue with valid cities
+  6. transactionally upsert snapshot, daily, and hourly records in D1
+  7. calculate versioned city/day/activity scores and ranking snapshots
+  8. write compact, versioned summary, forecast, ranking, and map read models to KV
+  9. validate the complete candidate and only then mark its snapshot active
+ 10. mark the run successful or partial and release the lock
+```
+
+Every user request follows the read-only path:
+
+```text
+User request
+  → Cloudflare CDN / Next.js route or Server Component
+  → application use case
+  → versioned KV read model
+  → on KV miss/error, parameterized D1 repository
+  → on D1 miss/transient failure, last-known-good stale KV/static result
+  → ViewModel → HTML or JSON
+
+User request ─X→ Open-Meteo / WeatherAPI
+```
+
+The read path never writes a weather read model, computes a score, or contacts a provider. D1 is the source of truth; KV contains replaceable compact read models.
+
+Roadmap: [REL-MVP-ARCH_DATAFLOW_001](11-Roadmap.md#REL-MVP-ARCH_DATAFLOW_001).
+
+#### Acceptance Criteria
+
+- An integration test observes zero provider calls for every public page and read-API use case, including cache misses.
+- A successful Cron run performs validation, D1 persistence, score/ranking generation, KV publication, and activation in the documented order.
+- A failed city is isolated and recorded while valid cities in the bounded batch remain eligible for publication.
+- User reads consistently resolve KV, then D1, then a last-known-good stale result and expose source freshness.
+- Only an activated, fully validated snapshot can become the basis of public rankings and read models.
+
