+# Database and Scoring
+
+> **Draft / Non-authoritative.** `SPEC.md` remains authoritative until the controlled documentation cutover. This document is the sole owner of D1 schema, indexes, data retention/migration rules, and deterministic score formulas. It does not redefine product presentation, API envelopes, rendering, or deployment procedure.
